.TH stralloc_start 3
.SH NAME
stralloc_start \- check if stralloc starts with a prefix
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "stralloc.h"
.PP
.BI "size_t stralloc_start(const stralloc *" sa ", const char *" s ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B stralloc_start
returns 1 if the null-terminated string
.I s
is a prefix of the contents of
.IR sa ,
and 0 otherwise.